  "steps": [
    "Drain the tins of potatoes and set to one side. Put the yoghurt, curry\npowder, turmeric, garam masala, ground coriander and sweetener in a\nbowl and mix. Add the potatoes, celery, spring onions and spinach to the\nbowl and mix together.",
